17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "d57ed010-daa6-567c-bb10-67266ffc6276" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=6 \\\\ -4x+8y &=-24.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system." :question/worked-solution "First, we set up the augmented matrix for the system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & 6 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -24\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & 6 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -24\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+4{R}_{1} \\\\  & \\sim\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=6 \\\\ 0x+0y &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSince any pair of numbers $x,y$ is a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of a single equation\n\n$$\nx-2y=6.\n$$\n\nThe first variable $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=2y+6,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=2y+6 \\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number.\n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2y+6 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186671796 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ed15d24-b898-586a-a1a1-7e7e533a2f67" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3y+6 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671769} {:answer/id #uuid "2d169cee-a67b-5603-8e29-2f8829f04404" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}6-3y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671774} {:answer/id #uuid "39e0e04c-93f9-54b5-a484-f2d9a60598be" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3y-6 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671781} {:answer/id #uuid "6c2f60bc-0c6b-5edf-9272-57f37aaea64a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3y-6 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671784} {:answer/id #uuid "f704f18e-d06d-5324-965f-8b94ff5810d2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671798}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f704f18e-d06d-5324-965f-8b94ff5810d2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671798} :answer-field/id #uuid "82fef62f-2021-5195-b1a6-5b8d877c6dd4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671788}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "f3181108-6901-544f-bc34-d0fa3617da7b" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+3y &=-6 \\\\ 2x+6y &=-7.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system." :question/worked-solution "First, we set up the augmented matrix for the system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -6 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -7\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -6 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -7\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & \\sim\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+3y &=-6 \\\\ 0x+0y &=5.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0x+0y=5$ has no solution. It simplifies to $0=5,$ which is a false statement.\n\nSo, there is no pair $x,y$ that satisfies both equations in the system. Consequently, the overall system has no solution."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186671799 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c9e038f-798b-5a50-a53e-3143e0ada903" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2y-8 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671770} {:answer/id #uuid "2717fde2-8f1c-5a54-b38d-87a66030d2a1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2y-8 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671772} {:answer/id #uuid "31f04780-6e99-5408-8c6e-46be312ca9ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4y-4 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671775} {:answer/id #uuid "d54b6829-c036-5c86-b2c1-d6fd61c6ff36" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}4y-4 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671794} {:answer/id #uuid "fde72c0c-5161-5b54-9d90-7d235457bc1e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671801}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fde72c0c-5161-5b54-9d90-7d235457bc1e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671801} :answer-field/id #uuid "562e43a0-eb15-5412-82fb-b582a3b8030e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671783}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "f9804fd7-a10f-5caf-8c5a-c0db8ce3b0c4" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=-8 \\\\ -3x+6y &=30.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system." :question/worked-solution "First, we set up the augmented matrix for the system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & -8 \\\\ -3 & 6 & 30\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & -8 \\\\ -3 & 6 & 30\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & \\sim\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=-8 \\\\ 0x+0y &=6.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0x+0y=6$ has no solution. It simplifies to $0=6,$ which is a false statement.\n\nSo, there is no pair $x,y$ that satisfies both equations in the system. Consequently, the overall system has no solution."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672884 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "218fd67a-ee4c-52bd-a4c8-5b48476ca438" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672880} {:answer/id #uuid "294d575b-6a0f-5ec8-88a1-61c1c78513e1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672881} {:answer/id #uuid "71d5aefe-2ebf-5648-aa3a-c63de4799f3c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672894} {:answer/id #uuid "cb1daa37-2c0c-5bc0-a35a-0c28671372d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672904} {:answer/id #uuid "ea5f850e-1eee-5fbf-89f1-3b66fc4764a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672908}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "71d5aefe-2ebf-5648-aa3a-c63de4799f3c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672894} :answer-field/id #uuid "eb1dbc06-257a-5ba4-b23d-fd05813aeb73" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672909}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "3a9b157b-a2cc-5c3c-94ba-fefc43ff6027" :question/problem "Find $k$, if $3{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $k$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 3\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+k\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ k\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}-3\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ k\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $k=-2.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672895 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e2503cd-4e34-5c65-85aa-2001f1cb5664" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672876} {:answer/id #uuid "3efd640c-dc44-5156-95f2-658c1ccec8ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672886} {:answer/id #uuid "43ffa6ef-d46c-5ee5-8442-f6dbb22c2ae5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672887} {:answer/id #uuid "712aafee-7d0f-5412-9af1-2d73d1ee4ab4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672893} {:answer/id #uuid "bfe744f6-b79d-594b-9b50-e03e0f8ae642" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672903}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "43ffa6ef-d46c-5ee5-8442-f6dbb22c2ae5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672887} :answer-field/id #uuid "6f2f51e4-dcd6-5aef-80ed-aa8aa682a664" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672891}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "8df737ca-89f5-51b3-bdc0-3e391ed913df" :question/problem "Find $h$, if $1{a}_{1}+h{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $h$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1{a}_{1}+h{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 1\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+h\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ h\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}-1\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ h\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $h=-7.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672900 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f8f49bb-7991-5c5d-a9c3-8e0c1c820637" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672877} {:answer/id #uuid "2c4acf3c-0c8f-577f-b1b2-3429379b6e7d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672882} {:answer/id #uuid "3d13558e-23f9-5830-9fc1-c62b14841b9b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672885} {:answer/id #uuid "bc6dbb87-8ba1-5ece-b861-83f3101d2030" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672902} {:answer/id #uuid "d2639e8b-4255-5100-8d34-db5c8f61d174" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672905}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bc6dbb87-8ba1-5ece-b861-83f3101d2030" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672902} :answer-field/id #uuid "b9b5ae06-57de-5cd7-9369-f290fb961700" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672901}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "b96f1363-dda9-567b-812a-57d61f053ef8" :question/problem "Find $m$, if $3{a}_{1}+m{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}11 \\\\ 10 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $m$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{a}_{1}+m{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 3\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+m\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}11 \\\\ 10 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ m\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}11 \\\\ 10 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}-3\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ m\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $m=-2.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672906 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "372be846-f1a3-5967-b847-472861c813b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672883} {:answer/id #uuid "45e1c0dd-85e4-5a7f-8c2d-e1715bf6acea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672888} {:answer/id #uuid "5607c1c2-87a6-564c-8a27-02aa966ab733" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672889} {:answer/id #uuid "b924c47f-bf8a-5401-9b86-9966630524b7" :answer/typ