rix}-1 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $t=-2.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672929 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "207a506b-bc9e-5f38-8dad-ecc43eea8165" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672913} {:answer/id #uuid "31310c10-5a20-573a-b91e-c053a759f650" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672917} {:answer/id #uuid "5b5bda93-f640-5f9e-8ee4-3cf5638e8e5b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672924} {:answer/id #uuid "bcbfcd38-8c25-5f9e-afaa-d65f0c7d4237" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672938} {:answer/id #uuid "e48a5a27-1b8e-5fa2-8837-2bbd1003de2a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672944}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5b5bda93-f640-5f9e-8ee4-3cf5638e8e5b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672924} :answer-field/id #uuid "e365304b-ea02-5e2a-bbbe-51ee320976e3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672943}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "7080715d-521e-5a43-9f55-40ddaf77bf62" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=6 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=3 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation we get ${x}_{2}=2$.\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{2}=2$ into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=3 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+(2) &=3 \\\\ -{x}_{1} &=1 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=2$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=6 \\\\ -(-1)+2(2) &=6 \\\\ 5 &=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a false statement.\n\nSo, the system has no solution."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672930 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "66dff891-db73-59a6-bb1d-8da004d792e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672927} {:answer/id #uuid "7c8d7203-c465-54cd-8a86-a85b87824924" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672931} {:answer/id #uuid "9577515d-8125-5a94-b2f4-965d1a3c08de" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672934} {:answer/id #uuid "95e226f3-d08f-5664-af9c-1f72c5002c53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 