{x}_{2} &=-16 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{2}=8$ into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-9 \\\\ {x}_{1}-(8) &=-9 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-1 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=8$ into the third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=21 \\\\ 2(-1)+3(8) &=21 \\\\ 22 &=21\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a false statement.\n\nSo, the system has no solution."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672933 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "24914a08-6ca2-5979-81ba-1266e5384c9c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672914} {:answer/id #uuid "2782144a-f583-5f44-bf8f-7dd00d00c944" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672915} {:answer/id #uuid "6bf83955-1a76-5c4d-a7e5-17c02bde0beb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672928} {:answer/id #uuid "bb577678-5bca-5273-8fe9-a9073fa7cec8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672937} {:answer/id #uuid "c074cc67-5110-57b1-b8c1-bc9f3e5ce882" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672940}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c074cc67-5110-57b1-b8c1-bc9f3e5ce882" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672940} :answer-field/id #uuid "02ecddd5-c526-508a-8258-5b17d18d93c8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672912}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "8ba31d16-ec9d-553c-9311-9b450daca5ec" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-8{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2} &=-14 \\\\ -{x}_{2} &=-4 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation we get ${x}_{2}=4$.\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{2}=4$ into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2} &=-14 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-8(4) &=-14 \\\\ 3{x}_{1} &=18 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=6$ and ${x}_{2}=4$ into the third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} &=4 \\\\ -2(6)+4(4) &=4 \\\\ 4 &=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement.\n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=6$ and ${x}_{2}=4$, which means\n\n$$\n6{a}_{1}+4{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=(6)+(4)=10.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672939 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "41bef361-971c-56d8-ae3d-27823ba753de" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672921} {:answer/id #uuid "5a6a38a0-25d7-5700-a747-f0946f89a9ab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672923} {:answer/id #uuid "63d5832e-bb1b-549f-b2ef-52efd7c8e58a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672926} {:answer/id #uuid "c1f82248-a0c2-51f0-ab73-fdd0225cce8f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672941} {:answer/id #uuid "fed157de-fd69-583d-ae90-d1b7f576fcca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672946}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fed157de-fd69-583d-ae90-d1b7f576fcca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672946} :answer-field/id #uuid "fe48ae11-3f8c-576a-bfbd-5ad6f7a3e449" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672945}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "bdf48f7c-668a-565f-9d26-2ee7cfe82070" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-6 \\\\ -{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=2 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nAdding the first and the second equations we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{2} &=-4 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{2}=2$ into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-6 \\\\ {x}_{1}-(2) &=-6 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-4 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-4$ and ${x}_{2}=2$ into the third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=-2 \\\\ 2(-4)+3(2) &=-2 \\\\ -2 &=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement.\n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=-4$ and ${x}_{2}=2$, which means\n\n$$\n-4{a}_{1}+2{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=(-4)+(2)=-2.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672942 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "34114716-c5fe-57a5-8c68-fa4671c2856d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672919} {:answer/id #uuid "417aced3-cecd-5c6e-9b54-620ed0fa7d66" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672920} {:answer/id #uuid "4f37d1e9-d6d5-511b-929e-5daabee10b71" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672922} {:answer/id #uuid "6351df06-c300-5540-806e-03612f39131f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672925} {:answer/id #uuid "87965bcd-038d-55e8-b8b1-063cfb5cbc32" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672932}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "87965bcd-038d-55e8-b8b1-063cfb5cbc32" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672932} :answer-field/id #uuid "314fd2be-ee25-534b-9545-406ab2b9929c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672918}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "c4f3ac65-f5aa-5829-9c88-6306ff37a902" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{c}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,{c}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,d=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -15 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{c}_{1}+{x}_{2}{c}_{2}=d,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$\n." :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{c}_{1}+{x}_{2}{c}_{2}=d$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -15 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 4{x}_{1} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -15 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -15 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=-5 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-15 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=-17\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nAdding the second and the third equations we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8{x}_{1} &=-32 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{1}=-4$ into the third equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=-17 \\\\ 4(-4)+{x}_{2} &=-17 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=-1 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-4$ and ${x}_{2}=-1$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=-5 \\\\ (-4)+2(-1) &=-5 \\\\ -6 &=-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a false statement.\n\nSo, the system has no solution."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672951 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c48c943-fba7-5b25-a278-0c2fba2a8b98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672955} {:answer/id #uuid "7ef92015-0f8a-5cc1-8bcb-6b3de588b866" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672970} {:answer/id #uuid "bc42bfa6-a4d6-5880-a1e0-9cea06f9c78b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672976} {:answer/id #uuid "bec23894-6e76-568c-bb56-0bc2a4971e38" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672977} {:answer/id #uuid "d77ad7b5-901d-5523-9f2f-306a8c425f04" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672980}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d77ad7b5-901d-5523-9f2f-306a8c425f04" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672980} :answer-field/id #uuid "444e2302-60e7-53c5-9812-499b99b124cf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672960}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "12013e4b-0191-5e66-95f1-55d982cbb9e2" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} \\\\ 3 x_{1} \\\\ - 2 x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 x_{2} \\\\ - 8 x_{2} \\\\ 6 x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 x_{3} \\\\ 5 x_{3} \\\\ - 3 x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} - 3 x_{2} + 2 x_{3} \\\\ 3 x_{1} - 8 x_{2} + 5 x_{3} \\\\ - 2 x_{1} + 6 x_{2} - 3 x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - 3 x_{2} + 2 x_{3} &=-4 \\\\ 3 x_{1} - 8 x_{2} + 5 x_{3} &=-10 \\\\ - 2 x_{1} + 6 x_{2} - 3 x_{3} &=8\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & -10 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & 8\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & -10 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & 8\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & 8\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}:=R_{2}+(-3)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(2)R_{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - 3 x_{2} + 2 x_{3} &=-4 \\\\ x_{2} - x_{3} &=2 \\\\ x_{3} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=0.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(-1)(0)=2\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=2\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\nx_1+(-3)(2)+(2)(0)=-4\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=2\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=2$, $x_2=2$, $x_3=0$, which means\n\n$$\n2a_1+(2)a_2+(0)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(2)+(2)+(0)=4.\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672953 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "18c1d7c0-4074-506f-a309-8ad1b1e25b63" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672954} {:answer/id #uuid "225cb7ae-802c-53b3-874f-adfcf2c89545" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "20" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672956} {:answer/id #uuid "6ae87310-261b-52d6-824c-4b7bd87268b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672967} {:answer/id #uuid "7860edbf-5a69-5a5a-94cb-322b35426715" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672968} {:answer/id #uuid "a7aca1a3-1023-5681-8635-df7b109c61dd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "22" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672974}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6ae87310-261b-52d6-824c-4b7bd87268b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672967} :answer-field/id #uuid "f1a678d7-68b0-5ce9-9e7b-4518d00bd4f9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672981}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "147eac2c-3a83-52e6-bae8-a772d5a224e2" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 29 \\\\ 25\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 29 \\\\ 25\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3 x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} \\\\ 5 x_{2} \\\\ 2 x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ x_{3} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 29 \\\\ 25\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} - x_{2} \\\\ 5 x_{2} + x_{3} \\\\ 3 x_{1} + 2 x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 29 \\\\ 25\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - x_{2} &=0 \\\\ 5 x_{2} + x_{3} &=29 \\\\ 3 x_{1} + 2 x_{2} &=25\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 & 29 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 0 & 25\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 & 29 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 0 & 25\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 & 29 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 & 25\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-3)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 & 29 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -4\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-1)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{1}{5} & \\frac{29}{5} \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -4\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}:=\\left(\\frac{1}{5}\\right)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{1}{5} & \\frac{29}{5} \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=(-1)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - x_{2} &=0 \\\\ x_{2} + \\frac{x_{3}}{5} &=\\frac{29}{5} \\\\ x_{3} &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=4.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+\\left(\\frac{1}{5}\\right)(4)=\\frac{29}{5}\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=5\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\nx_1+(-1)(5)+(0)(4)=0\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=5\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=5$, $x_2=5$, $x_3=4$, which means\n\n$$\n5a_1+(5)a_2+(4)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(5)+(5)+(4)=14.\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672958 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0481921c-737c-512b-9287-7a7e7cb48246" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672948} {:answer/id #uuid "14203d7c-5c1b-519d-a6d8-01ee09812ea9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672952} {:answer/id #uuid "5022b2c1-4ff2-51b3-aeab-4053ab5569ae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672964} {:answer/id #uuid "c17cb451-9d86-5b97-8ed4-c51e4621dcc9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672978} {:answer/id #uuid "fed86eaa-9594-5449-97ea-1ed3e3d20abb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-32" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672982}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0481921c-737c-512b-9287-7a7e7cb48246" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672948} :answer-field/id #uuid "36c4941a-359f-5703-b0fb-263c9065b383" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672959}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "31a35ba8-70d4-56fd-99b3-1c7e27df0350" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} \\\\ x_{2} \\\\ x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 x_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5 x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} - x_{2} + 2 x_{3} \\\\ x_{2} \\\\ x_{1} + x_{2} + 5 x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - x_{2} + 2 x_{3} &=-2 \\\\ x_{2} &=-1 \\\\ x_{1} + x_{2} + 5 x_{3} &=-4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 5 & -4\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 5 & -4\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 3 & -2\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 0\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-2)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - x_{2} + 2 x_{3} &=-2 \\\\ x_{2} &=-1 \\\\ x_{3} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=0.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(0)(0)=-1\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=-1\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\nx_1+(-1)(-1)+(2)(0)=-2\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=-3\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=-3$, $x_2=-1$, $x_3=0$, which means\n\n$$\n-3a_1+(-1)a_2+(0)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(-3)+(-1)+(0)=-4.\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672962 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "27085e70-0921-54c4-85d2-4628ee37e871" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672957} {:answer/id #uuid "473b0fed-1baf-5b21-8e59-e7583c7470aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672961} {:answer/id #uuid "6782314a-88a0-519e-a91f-9d0a9cae538e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672965} {:answer/id #uuid "a333a6a9-cc20-5abc-aa8c-51674d9728ac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672972} 