ugmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 0 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 0 & 6\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -2 & 12\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-2)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4 & 16\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(1)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -4\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=\\left(- \\frac{1}{4}\\right)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{3} &=-3 \\\\ x_{2} - 2 x_{3} &=4 \\\\ x_{3} &=-4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=-4.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(-2)(-4)=4\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=-4\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\nx_1+(0)(-4)+(1)(-4)=-3\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=1\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=1$, $x_2=-4$, $x_3=-4$, which means\n\n$$\n1a_1+(-4)a_2+(-4)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(1)+(-4)+(-4)=-7.\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672979 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "05db9f38-531a-57a8-8ed6-1077065a7257" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672949} {:answer/id #uuid "0a1e90e2-40e8-5636-bcdb-4019af4e4676" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672950} {:answer/id #uuid "7a3a9230-e49c-5fb1-9181-6d935627f64b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672969} {:answer/id #uuid "8da8baf7-9cb4-597e-bb17-6e74d31ac70d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672971} {:answer/id #uuid "acecb867-93ec-5a33-b47e-b1744d7aa73b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672975}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "05db9f38-531a-57a8-8ed6-1077065a7257" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672949} :answer-field/id #uuid "4841a2ba-e729-5d5a-9b30-9d8da775c96a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672963}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "cb3b6978-3983-5397-b56f-70c9f5f783c0" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -11 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -11 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}x_{2} \\\\ - 2 x_{2} \\\\ 2 x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3 x_{3} \\\\ - 11 x_{3} \\\\ x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} + x_{2} + 3 x_{3} \\\\ - 2 x_{2} - 11 x_{3} \\\\ x_{1} + 2 x_{2} + x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{2} + 3 x_{3} &=14 \\\\ - 2 x_{2} - 11 x_{3} &=-48 \\\\ x_{1} + 2 x_{2} + x_{3} &=8\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -48 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 & 8\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -48 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 & 8\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -48 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -48\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}\\leftrightarrow R_{3} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -15 & -60\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(2)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=\\left(- \\frac{1}{15}\\right)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{2} + 3 x_{3} &=14 \\\\ x_{2} - 2 x_{3} &=-6 \\\\ x_{3} &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=4.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(-2)(4)=-6\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=2\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\nx_1+(1)(2)+(3)(4)=14\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=0\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=0$, $x_2=2$, $x_3=4$, which means\n\n$$\n0a_1+(2)a_2+(4)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(0)+(2)+(4)=6.\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672993 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2685f03d-3747-5ebb-a7e9-417f05cd88e1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672990} {:answer/id #uuid "4f48e242-bbec-5f34-a357-e3ad36608b17" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672997} {:answer/id #uuid "a222991a-a067-504f-83a4-ccb8446d3a4a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673007} {:answer/id #uuid "be0c4ebc-6a4a-5a57-9549-df94c0eda48f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673010} {:answer/id #uuid "f2b01e26-222c-5335-8446-48e735df494f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673017}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "be0c4ebc-6a4a-5a57-9549-df94c0eda48f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673010} :answer-field/id #uuid "7430df76-47bf-598c-927a-f8f6267d31ea" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673002}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "3135e2ae-fa22-5d42-9195-c31f993efe72" :question/problem "Find the value of ${x}_{4}-{x}_{1}$ given that  $6a-2x=b$ and\n\n$$\na=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix},\\,x=\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ 10 \\\\ 48 \\\\ -10\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6a-2x & =b \\\\ -2x & =b-6a \\\\ x & =-\\frac{1}{2}(b-6a) \\\\ x & =-\\frac{1}{2}(\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ 10 \\\\ 48 \\\\ -10\\end{bmatrix}-6\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\ x & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 12 \\\\ 14\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ x & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${x}_{4}-{x}_{1}=-7-1=-8.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672994 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "29d2aaa6-5a39-5de1-ae62-e2d87f6fa287" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672991} {:answer/id #uuid "4173b500-2737-5fea-9fb2-ff1741d71e8b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672995} {:answer/id #uuid "7e8a3189-9f25-5d13-bf3f-7ef7a566c376" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673005} {:answer/id #uuid "d0d368a5-48f3-588f-b8c6-c8f0bb057f03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673014} {:answer/id #uuid "f0f239f2-2bbe-5013-896a-c306d2104477" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673016}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "29d2aaa6-5a39-5de1-ae62-e2d87f6fa287" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672991} :answer-field/id #uuid "1384b052-885d-5973-81e4-c3ed2cb3be6d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672987}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "3445d92d-2ea4-570f-8236-ff111b2dd1ad" :question/problem "Find the value of ${x}_{2}+{x}_{3}$ given that $3a-5x=b$ and\n\n$$\na=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,x=\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}12 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 17\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3a-5x & =b \\\\ -5x & =b-3a \\\\ x & =-\\frac{1}{5}(b-3a) \\\\ x & =-\\frac{1}{5}(\\begin{bmatrix}12 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 17\\end{bmatrix}-3\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\ x & =-\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}15 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 20\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ x & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=2-4=-2.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186673008 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "251b00e4-d6a0-5dca-b3cf-91b0c40c303d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672989} {:answer/id #uuid "55236790-0fc8-5fb6-8d15-514a6aa1121e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672998} {:answer/id #uuid "768a3a47-2890-5106-9c63-0a491cf350a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673003} {:answer/id #uuid "918efaa2-666f-54d2-88d9-79635dc49aee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673006} {:answer/id #uuid "ca6ca64d-0bef-5cf5-9556-a7b630c45bae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673013}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "918efaa2-666f-54d2-88d9-79635dc49aee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 175