ce that a matrix of rank $3$ must have at least $3$ columns and at least $3$ rows. \nSo, we disregard the matrix $B$ since it has only $2$ rows. \n\nAlso, the matrix must have $3$ pivot columns. As we can see, the matrices  $C$ and $A$ have exactly $3$ pivot columns.  So, $\\text{rank}(C)=\\text{rank}(A)=3.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answers are \"$C$  and $A$ only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186673080 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c8c8adbe-c1eb-5cee-b695-0da076021558" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673095} {:answer/id #uuid "cc8dbf60-176a-5e27-8f92-236803ad83ed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673097}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cc8dbf60-176a-5e27-8f92-236803ad83ed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673097} :answer-field/id #uuid "0a44ba50-4fc7-5d72-9e43-4c1e485bea6c" :answer-field/key "$B=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 & 6 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 4 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673059} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1111bcf4-a091-5f56-a617-8605ad060b12" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673062} {:answer/id #uuid "a9503360-ddb6-5674-aa1c-e30aaefce100" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673088}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a9503360-ddb6-5674-aa1c-e30aaefce100" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673088} :answer-field/id