#uuid "f2a24c9e-618a-5202-9ff3-cd93a55078cc" :answer-field/key "$B=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 & 6 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 4 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673102}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "aefdf69a-f5d3-5963-8daa-c505e8da8115" :question/problem "Which of the following matrices have a rank of $5?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "First, notice that a matrix of rank $5$ must have at least $5$ columns and at least $5$ rows. \nSo, we disregard the matrix $A$ since it has only $3$ rows and the matrix $C$ since it has only $4$ columns. \n\nAlso, the matrix must have $5$ pivot columns. As we can see, the matrix $B$ has exactly $5$ pivot columns. So, $\\text{rank}(B)=5.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$B$ only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186688365 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "62446b77-7f2c-5675-a662-914bad181e2c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688362} {:answer/id #uuid "63210029-856c-501a-a7a2-69b14141338a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688364} {:answer/id #uuid "6df18ee5-c0fb-52fe-9adc-b374067ce00d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688366} {:answer/id #uuid "85828004-7286-5782-bb52-058f7052d440" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688370} {:answer/id #uuid "d4fc62b6-f6cd-5132-af74-e774c296228e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688375}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "85828004-7286-5782-bb52-058f7052d440" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688370} :answer-field/id #uuid "9e64d75a-b5dc-5ec1-bc46-cd0188eeb9be" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688372}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "69966b3b-64a2-57a4-b6b9-f1a97a958c17" :question/problem "Find $s$, if $2\\mathbf{a}_1+s\\mathbf{a}_2=\\mathbf{b}$ and\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ -13\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Isolate the term containing $s$ using vector subtraction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+s\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ -13\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ s\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ -13\\end{bmatrix}-2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ s\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -9\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe first component gives $-2s=6$, so $s=-3$. Check both components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-3)\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -9\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBoth components agree, so $s=-3$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186688369 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1dc38080-2e15-58d8-8553-25aae7e5e246" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688358} {:answer/id #uuid "3bdddb89-b912-560f-91a2-d849d65ab929" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688359} {:answer/id #uuid "44f99e05-193c-558c-b91c-8692491222db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688360} {:answer/id #uuid "629ad888-ef0f-534a-b3dd-da30cb37736a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688363} {:answer/id #uuid "6f6e2c8c-75fb-5ab0-9fcd-0dd970ee107a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688367}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1dc38080-2e15-58d8-8553-25aae7e5e246" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688358} :answer-field/id #uuid "f8341cbd-f056-5492-8c2a-f590737d0fe6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186688378}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "7cba3fda-74eb-5e0a-83b1-57eaf96270cf" :question/problem "Find $k$, if $3\\mathbf{a}_1+k\\mathbf{a}_2=\\mathbf{0}$ and\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Isolate the term containing $k$ using vector subtraction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+k\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ k\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}-3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ k\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe first component requires $-3k=-6$, so $k=2$. But this value must also satisfy the second component:\n\n$$\n2\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\\ne \\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nEquivalently, the second component requires $2k=3$, or $k=\\frac{3}{2}$, which conflicts with $k=2$. No single scalar satisfies the vector equation. Select **No solution**."}]}
